# Django Multi-User Todo App

A simple multi-user **Todo web application** built with **Django 6**.
This app allows users to **sign up, log in, add, edit, delete, and manage their todos** with inline editing on a single page. Each user has their own todo list.

---

## Features

- User authentication:
  - Signup
  - Login
  - Logout
- Multi-user support: Each user sees only their own todos.
- Todo management:
  - Add new todos
  - Edit todos inline (click "Edit" to update)
  - Delete todos
- Clean UI with simple CSS.
- Inline editing with Save/Cancel buttons.
- Secure: Users cannot modify other users’ todos.

---

## Tech Stack

- Python 3.14
- Django 6.0.2
- SQLite (default Django database)
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript (for inline editing)

